+
+It writes 6 vectors (3 orthonormal pairs, the 5 vectors requested being completed to whole pairs), computed by the `angles` algorithm, to the file `vectors.txt`. The number of vectors and the algorithm are the arguments of the function `main` of the script: edit the call to `main` at the end of the script to change them.
